Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Upper-Intermediate level!

3
00:00:15.165 --> 00:00:19.979
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:20.029 --> 00:00:24.133
Today we learn: Environmental Policy. Let's go!

5
00:00:24.829 --> 00:00:29.679
Carbon footprint. Say it with me. Carbon footprint!

6
00:00:33.193 --> 00:00:38.276
Renewable energy. Say it with me. Renewable energy!

7
00:00:41.836 --> 00:00:46.002
Regulation. Say it with me. Regulation!

8
00:00:49.423 --> 00:00:53.089
Emission. Say it with me. Emission!

9
00:00:56.579 --> 00:01:01.179
Climate action. Say it with me. Climate action!

10
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:09.283
Policy reform. Say it with me. Policy reform!

11
00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:18.581
Sustainability goal. Say it with me. Sustainability goal!

12
00:01:22.069 --> 00:01:26.785
Green initiative. Say it with me. Green initiative!

13
00:01:30.271 --> 00:01:34.471
Mitigation. Say it with me. Mitigation!

14
00:01:38.008 --> 00:01:42.074
Advocacy. Say it with me. Advocacy!

15
00:01:45.554 --> 00:01:56.207
Grammar time! Passive with need to be. Listen. Policies need to be reformed for real climate action.

16
00:01:56.257 --> 00:02:03.038
Your turn. Say it with me. Policies need to be reformed for real climate action.

17
00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:20.993
Reducing our carbon footprint requires renewable energy and strong regulation. Climate action depends on policy reform and every green initiative toward a sustainability goal.

18
00:02:21.043 --> 00:02:22.683
I like this story!

19
00:02:23.621 --> 00:02:28.899
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:28.949 --> 00:02:30.132
Regulation!

21
00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:36.425
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:36.475 --> 00:02:38.311
Sustainability goal!

23
00:02:39.535 --> 00:02:48.853
Think and answer. What environmental policy would you support?

24
00:02:48.903 --> 00:02:50.232
Great answer!

25
00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:55.647
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
